    // Smooth 16-bit frequency: $0800..$0FF0..$0800, opposite on SID2.
    // Two-times-longer cycle and quiet persistent noise beds (voice 2, sustain 1).
    // Staggered voice-3 gates for overlap; master volumes untouched.
    // PETSCII editor artwork, 40x25, user-owned bytes preserved verbatim.
    // $1000-$13E7 and $1400-$17E7: CPU RAM under VIC charset-ROM window.
